47	  /// revert/confirm stomp a newer call's already-settled value, because
48	  /// each call's own PATCH round-trip resolves independently of the
49	  /// others. Mirrors `VaultRepositoryImpl._submitPinGeneration`'s same
50	  /// fix for the exact same class of bug: every call captures the
51	  /// generation current at its OWN start; only the call whose captured
52	  /// generation still matches this field once its PATCH resolves is
